WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:12.540
I'm a two-wheeled handcart called the MET — the astronauts nicknamed me the ‘rickshaw’. I carried their tools up a hill.

2
00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:21.290
Not far from me, two golf balls are still lying in the dust, hit by Alan Shepard with a homemade club.

3
00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:27.100
Somewhere near me, two golf balls are still waiting to be found.
